.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    Help someone produce apply-ready
    %strong draft MAAP proposals
    through a guided chat — starting with a focus on Seat, Assignment, or Abilities.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  = render "shared/maap/definition"

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li
      %strong Beta.
      Experimental. Expect rough edges; send feedback. Each conversation counts as one Consult OG Value Billing unit (not each reply).
    %li
      The chat asks or infers a
      %strong focus
      first:
      %strong Seat
      (Seat + Title + Position + Assignments + Abilities),
      %strong Assignment
      (Assignment + Abilities), or
      %strong Abilities.
      Team focus comes later.
    %li Prefer editing existing objects when a close match exists; create only when needed. Near-misses should be disclosed.
    %li
      When ready, OG shows a summary and Confirm action(s). Confirm creates
      %em draft
      proposals only — nothing is applied automatically. One Confirm may create multiple drafts.
    %li
      Recent conversations show
      %strong In progress
      (still chatting),
      %strong Draft being reviewed
      (Confirm summary ready), or
      %strong Suggestion created
      (proposal drafts were created) — not raw completed/failed job statuses.
    %li
      Prefer direct propose forms when you already know the object shape —
      = link_to "Proposed Seat creates", organization_maap_seat_creates_path(@organization)
      = "."
